    "description": {
      "value": "You have long been gifted with the ability to see and speak with the departed. This could have manifested at your birth or when a chance encounter linked you inextricably to the spirits of the dead. Their constant presence might feel like a curse, or it might provide you with welcome companionship.\n\nYou gain one ability boost. It must be to Constitution or Wisdom.\n\nYou're trained in Religion and Undead Lore. You gain the effects of the spirit sense spell at all times."
